{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19259","headline":"早秋送台院杨侍御归朝 · 刘禹锡","name":"早秋送台院杨侍御归朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙署棣华春，当时已绝伦。\n今朝丹阙下，更入白眉人。\n重振高阳族，分居要路津。\n一门科第足，五府辟书频。\n鸷鸟得秋气，法星悬火旻。\n圣朝寰海静，所至不埋轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}